      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional info: This is caused by the \"Maximum Avatar Download Size\" set to \"No Limit\". Setting the option to 1000 MB \"fixes\" the issue. A wild guess is that \"No Limit\" really is handled as 0 MB internally and as such all avatars are being perf-blocked.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
