      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I still see this issue to this day occasionally (and so do others, i tell them how to correct it).  I can trigger it by changing my dynamic bone limiter settings for example, and having to change and change back my download limit to correct the issue.\nWith the new fallback system people are going to be even less aware of when this issue arises and end up seeing the wrong avatar without realizing it at all.  This adds to social complications.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
