  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One of the recent updates caused avatars to get randomly perf blocked despite all (but visitor) safety settings set to show avatar and min perf rank set to VeryPoor. This also happens for friends with default avatar visibility.\nSafety settings are set to:\nVisitors: Voice\nNew User: Voice, Avatar\nUser: Voice, Avatar\nKnown User: Voice, Avatar\nTrusted User: Voice, Avatar\nFriends: Voice, Avatar\nMin Perf Rank: VeryPoor\nMax DL Size: No Limit\nLimit Dyn Bone: No\nWhen loading into a world and avatars are perf blocked, toggling Voice for Visitors off is enough to trigger a reload of all avatars which causes those avatars to actually load, re-enabling Voice for Visitors reloads the avatars again but leaves the previously perf blocked avatars loaded now.\nDemonstration video showing this behavior: https://youtu.be/mH9chzo4imo",
